Subject: [PATCH 2/6] feat: add discount-code rules and turn a code into an
 adjustment

Validates new codes (3-20 letters and digits, 1-50%, expiry not in the past)
and works out a code's adjustment at checkout. Codes expire at the end of
their expiry date in UK time, via a new clock.today().

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
